# Netlify redirects — Vanessa Flow Yoga
# Source of truth: docs/url-migration-map.md. Do not edit here without updating that doc.
# Format: /old-path  /new-path  301
# Blog posts: ALL live posts are rebuilt at their original /post/<slug> URLs,
# so there are NO blog-post redirects — nothing moved, nothing to redirect.

# --- Content editor (admin.vanessaflowyoga.co.uk) ---------------------------
#     The subdomain is a Netlify domain alias on this same site. Its root serves
#     the editor; the two /oauth routes are the GitHub sign-in relay.
https://admin.vanessaflowyoga.co.uk/  /admin/index.html  200
/oauth/auth      /.netlify/functions/auth      200
/oauth/callback  /.netlify/functions/callback  200

# --- Block internal files from being served (they ship in the folder but
#     must not be public). 404! forces the block even though the file exists. ---
/CLAUDE.md    /404.html  404!
/docs/*       /404.html  404!
/mockups/*    /404.html  404!
/.claude/*    /404.html  404!

